listings.description_text:
440 Prospect Steet, New Haven, CT 06511 
General information:
- one bedroom, one bathroom apartment (650 ft2) on first floor;
- condominium building with 12 units occupied by Yale affiliated tenants;
- recently renovated;
- spacious living / dining room;
- two walk in closets;
- basic furniture (kings size bed, nightstands, couch, table, chairs, standing lamps);
- heating with new gas furnace, (forced hot air) water heater with gas burner;
- kitchen with electric stove (exhaust hood vented to outside);
- new central AC (controlled by thermostat in living room);
- plenty of closet space;
- GE fridge, electric Samsung stove;
- windows facing West, South-West, plenty of light;
- off street, private, free parking behind the building;
- commercial washer/drier in the basement;
Location:
East Rock area, 440 Prospect Street Apt. 6, on first floor;
Building in front of Yale School of Divinity;
- furnished living-room, bedroom;
- tenant pays utilities: electricity and gas
- free, off street parking behind the building;
- additional storage in the basement;
- commercial laundry ($2.75 / load) in the basement;
- Yale shuttle bus stop in front of the building;
- quiet, beautiful, safe area;
- walking distance to certain Yale departments, parks, downtown;
- no smoking, no pets;
- renewable one year lease;
- apartment restricted to singles only;
- Yale graduate students and postdocs encouraged;
- the last pictures show views from the apartment and to the parking lot

